menu "GDEY042Z98 e-paper configuration"

    config EPD_BUSY_GPIO
        int "BUSY signal GPIO (-1 if not connected)"
        range -1 48
        default 47
        help
            Connect this to the panel BUSY signal when available. The SSD1683
            drives BUSY high during reset and refresh. If left at -1, the
            firmware uses a conservative fixed delay after a full refresh.

endmenu
